WEBVTT

00:03:29.372 --> 00:03:30.807
And so I said really quickly,

00:03:30.841 --> 00:03:32.876
"When I grow up,
I'm going to be a lawyer,"

00:03:32.909 --> 00:03:34.544
and then I exit stage left.

00:03:35.679 --> 00:03:37.881
But fast-forward to two years ago

00:03:37.914 --> 00:03:41.485
and I get an opportunity
to spend time at an institution

00:03:41.485 --> 00:03:45.388
known for creating
and cultivating great thinkers.

00:03:45.422 --> 00:03:47.057
Little did I know at the time

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.626
that there's a ritual
at the Kennedy School

00:03:49.659 --> 00:03:53.964
where students get an opportunity
to stand on the famous forum stage

00:03:53.997 --> 00:03:57.000
and they're given 15 seconds to say

00:03:57.033 --> 00:04:00.237
what they were going to do
at the Kennedy School.